# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# Every client-side route (/, /login, /dashboard, /trains, ...) is served by the
# React router, so a direct visit or a browser refresh must resolve to
# index.html instead of returning a 404. Cloudflare Pages matches real static
# assets first, so this rule only catches application routes.
# No secret is ever placed in a Cloudflare environment variable - AI provider
# credentials (GEMINI_API_KEY) belong to the Render backend only.
/*    /index.html   200